<title>UK: T-Dual sets 25 billion yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>T-Dual sets 25 billion yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   T-DUAL</p>
<p> AMT    25 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.2O	MATURITY   *17.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-20.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.615     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI ANN</p>
<p> NOTES    *REDEMPTION IN US$ AT A RATE OF $3.956 PER YEN 500,000</p>
<p>	     NOTE.</p>
<p>	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
